      "context_excerpt": "Avathon , an industrial automation platform provider, uses the NVIDIA Blueprint for video search and summarization (VSS), part of NVIDIA Metropolis, to provide manufacturing and energy facilities with real-time insights that improve operational efficiency and worker safety.",
