      "context_excerpt": "The latest version of Cosmos Reason — NVIDIA’s advanced open, customizable, 7-billion-parameter reasoning VLM for physical AI — enables contextual video understanding, temporal event reasoning for Metropolis use cases. Its compact size makes it easy to deploy from edge to cloud and ideal for automating traffic monitoring, public safety, visual inspection and intelligent decision-making.",
